<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-δύνω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Flat.</u>
			13
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>de An.</u>
			404a7
		</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			2.66
		</span></i> codd.; more freq. Dep.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδύομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δύσομαι</span>: aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέδυν</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slip through</i> a hole or gap, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδύντες διὰ τοῦ τείχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τούτων ἡ φιλία διαδυομένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.6.22
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>slip through, slip away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					212
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶν ὁ γέρων πῃ
			διαδύεται;</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				396
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>evade, shirk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς διαδυομένοις τὰς λειτουργίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					21.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				42.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπῃ . . διαδύσεται τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					231c
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δίκην δοῦναι διαδύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.133
				</span></i>
			.</div>
